s for Automobiles > Electrical System', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-md6951eub1v6ee', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1350808941%2F22593494597', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
